'''Baliscanism''' ({{Lang-bl|baliscanismo}}) or '''Baliscan patriotism''' refers to a [[W:Patriotism|patriotism]] involving cultural attachment of [[Baliscans]] to [[Balisca]] as their [[W:Homeland|homeland]], while highlighting it's "[[W:Salad bowl (cultural idea)|salad bowl]]" ([[W:Multicultural|multicultural]]) society. It has been identified as distinct from, and in some cases adversarial to, [[Baliscan nationalism]]. In contemporary times, this patriotism has commonly emphasized Balisca as a [[W:Plurinationalism|plurinational]] [[W:Cosmopolitanism|cosmopolitan]] society. 
